+
+**Language/Version**: Language-neutral; no source or runtime manifest exists.  
+**Primary Dependencies**: Reminder dispatcher and provider adapter; no library is selected.  
+**Storage**: Transactional relational-style persistence (reversible assumption; no storage evidence exists).  
