+**Target Platform**: Backend reminder-processing path.  
+**Project Type**: Single backend/service component.  
+**Performance Goals**: Keep transactions short; never hold one during provider network I/O.  
+**Constraints**: Atomic accounting, exactly-once terminal effect, non-negative balance, duplicate-safe callbacks.  
+**Scale/Scope**: One credit per provider retry, scoped by workspace.
