+| Short DB critical section | Commit reservation before provider I/O | None | Hold provider fake; verify no transaction is open | Assigned by `/story-tasks` |
+| No negative balance | Conditional decrement/lock | None | Concurrent integration test | Assigned by `/story-tasks` |
